{"author":"rebar-bridge[bot]","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1794434337020632993,"compiled_state":{"alias":"garlicky-leery-seal","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"858bb4c3ea21c5a02f4b85a68abba138b092bbd935df2117fdcb55adb09f7fb9","event_uuid":"be23688a-ed31-4564-8ff4-67294442acc5","position":{"commit_sha":"5f9da23b88226b79fee619181bc2c70e4f83895f","position":"1794434252581100686-be23688a-ed31-4564-8ff4-67294442acc5"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"5a81ec157729c2e42b1af721cec5d260364e8a1929f9bd41d889d281b7f90629","event_uuid":"dd61d487-b1e7-4cda-a4ba-2167f0b1372a","position":{"commit_sha":"96cf7536a46a297af926c98d768ef393533b66ae","position":"1794434337020632992-dd61d487-b1e7-4cda-a4ba-2167f0b1372a"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1794434252581100686,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"dd61d487-b1e7-4cda-a4ba-2167f0b1372a","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"8501-0e78-cbac-4b03"}],"description":"## Observation\nWhile live-probing the sampling fix (tapestried-oversize-blackfly, 2026-11-11), driving `us.meta.llama4-maverick-17b-instruct-v1:0` through rebar's agentic runner on Bedrock Converse (us-west-2) failed with a pydantic-ai Bedrock model-profile `KeyError: 'bedrock_supports_strict_tool_definition'`. Single-turn calls to the same model were not the failing path. Unrelated to sampling parameters.\n\n## Not yet established\n- Whether it reproduces on current main (cf7e6e91873 or later) and with the pinned `pydantic-ai-slim` version.\n- Whether rebar builds the profile dict itself (a missing key on rebar's side) or pydantic-ai's Meta profile omits the key (upstream defect).\n- Which other non-Anthropic Bedrock families hit the same path.\n\n## Approach\n1. Reproduce deterministically with a fake Converse client driving the agentic runner for a `us.meta.*` id.\n2. Locate where `bedrock_supports_strict_tool_definition` is read and which profile supplies it.\n3. Fix on the side that owns the defect; add a regression test covering every Bedrock vendor prefix rebar resolves.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] A test that fails on the pre-fix tree reproduces the KeyError for a `us.meta.*` model through the agentic runner.\n- [ ] The root cause is recorded with evidence (rebar-side or upstream).\n- [ ] The agentic runner completes a tool-using turn for `us.meta.llama4-maverick-17b-instruct-v1:0` (test, plus a live probe recorded as a comment).\n- [ ] `make verify` passes.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"a81a-946a-31c9-4d03","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Agentic runner fails on Bedrock Llama 4 Maverick with a pydantic-ai profile KeyError","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["be23688a-ed31-4564-8ff4-67294442acc5","dd61d487-b1e7-4cda-a4ba-2167f0b1372a"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1794434337020632993,"uuid":"6efe72fa-e0a5-4e87-85f9-3e445b523cb9"}